    <cac:ProcurementProject xmlns="">
        <cbc:Name languageID="ENG">Tender for the Provision of a Plagiarism Detection Solution to MTU</cbc:Name>
        <cbc:Description languageID="ENG">Munster Technological University is seeking tenders from competent service providers for the supply of a Plagiarism Detection Solution. The University is seeking a plagiarism detection solution that can be used to compare submitted assessments and course-work with an extensive range of public web, subscription-based sources and other student work. Students and teaching staff alike should be able to use the solution to clearly and quickly identify similarity and common elements between submitted work and other prior work or sources with a view to supporting learning and to facilitate the implementation of the University’s policy regarding academic honesty and assessment infringement. Full details can be found in the tender document attached to this Contract Notice.</cbc:Description>
